# --- runtime secrets / generated / build (NEVER committed) ---
# ALL stack state (generated envs, rendered runtime configs, config hashes,
# the ChatGPT token) lives under .stack/<svc>/ — gitignored wholesale here.
# Templates stay tracked in service dirs (*.template).
.stack/
# Renamed-on-cutover holdover for the bash flow's state. Same shape +
# same secrets as .stack/, just under a different name.
.stack-bash/
**/*.generated.env
# Top-level compose is GENERATED from docker-compose.example.yaml + the
# enabled COMPOSE_PROFILES by stack_render_compose. Path anchored to repo
# root so per-service `services/*/compose.yaml` files stay tracked.
/docker-compose.yaml
# Build-from-source clones (pinned commit, re-cloned by build scripts).
**/_source/

# --- editor / bak ---
*.bak
*.bak.*
.bak/
# Repo-root backup dir convention (e.g. _bak/.stack.<timestamp>/). NEVER
# put .stack/ backups in /tmp — secrets leak; world-readable; forgotten.
_bak/

.claude/*.lock
.claude/worktrees

# --- Node / TS scripts ---
# scripts/node_modules is .gitignored via scripts/.gitignore; this catches
# any stray node_modules that pnpm/npm/bun might dump at the repo root if
# a command is mistakenly run from the wrong cwd.
node_modules/
/bun.lock

# --- Python ---
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/

**/mission-control/tmp
